<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche sets warrants on basket of British firms.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on basket of British firms.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Thursday it expected to issue 680 million American-style call warrants on a basket of British-funded companies.</p>
<p>The basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd    0.18 share</p>
<p> Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd 0.05 share</p>
<p> Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot;	   0.06 share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$9.81    PREMIUM	 12.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.249   GEARING	 4.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   05.JUN.98  DENOMINATION  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$10.90   LISTING DATE  09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG  PAY DATE	07.JUL.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   EXERCISE DELIVERY BY CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
